cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
title: "@three-ws/onchain-agent-wallets"
abstract: "Give an AI agent a real Solana wallet without giving it your money. The agent gets a spending allowance the SPL Token program enforces on-chain, plus guardrails (per-tx cap, daily cap, recipient and host allowlists, expiry, kill switch), x402 payments, and a one-call on-chain deploy. Custody never leaves your wallet: you can revoke or withdraw at any moment, and the agent can never spend past the delegated ceiling."
version: 0.1.1
